#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Black Box"
msgstr "Scatola nera"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore the underwater world looking for another black box."
msgstr "Esplora il mondo sommerso alla ricerca di un’altra scatola nera."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Locate and retrieve another <a object|bbox>black box</a> from the previous "
"expedition."
msgstr ""
"Trova e recupera un’altra <a object|bbox>scatola nera</a> della spedizione "
"precedente."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The observation satellite seems to have spotted it underwater. Water is "
"harmless to you as long as you wear your helmet but keep in mind that you "
"can't carry objects underwater. A <a object|botsub>subber</a> may come in "
"handy."
msgstr ""
"Il satellite sembra averla individuata sott’acqua. Con il casco l’acqua non "
"è pericolosa, ma ricorda che non puoi trasportare oggetti quando sei "
"immerso. Un <a object|botsub>robot sommergibile</a> potrebbe esserti utile."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8 ../help/soluce.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/report.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Report"
msgstr "Rapporto satellitare"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently in a geo-stationary orbit of Tropica."
msgstr "Attualmente in orbita geostazionaria attorno a Tropica."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SURFACE<c/>"
msgstr "-> SUPERFICIE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Temperature:      29.4C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosphere:       helium, oxygen\n"
"\\tab;Wind:             0.3 mps\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     some\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Temperatura:      29.4C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosfera:       elio, ossigeno\n"
"\\tab;Vento:             0.3 mps\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     presente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SUBSOIL<c/>"
msgstr "-> SOTTOSUOLO<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Energy source:    none\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     none\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Fonte di energia:    assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<c/>"
msgstr "-> INFORMAZIONI AGGIUNTIVE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Detected:         titanium ore\n"
"\\tab;  - Requires:     converter\n"
"\\tab;Detected:         scattered derelicts\n"
"\\tab;Detected:         black box (underwater)"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Rilevato:         minerale di titanio\n"
"\\tab;  - Richiede:     convertitore\n"
"\\tab;Rilevato:         relitti sparsi\n"
"\\tab;Rilevato:         scatola nera (sott’acqua)"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walkthrough"
msgstr "Soluzione"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Locate the <a object|bbox>black box</a> on your own. You can try to spot it "
"from above, using your jet engine, or dive into the water."
msgstr ""
"Cerca personalmente la <a object|bbox>scatola nera</a>: puoi tentare di "
"avvistarla dall’alto con il propulsore oppure immergerti."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a <a object|convert>converter</a> near the chunks of titanium ore. "
"You'll find them in the vicinity of the spaceship to the east."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci un <a object|convert>convertitore</a> vicino al minerale di "
"titanio. Lo troverai nei pressi dell’astronave, verso est."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Produce two <a object|titan>cubes</a>."
msgstr "Produci due <a object|titan>cubi</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a <a object|factory>bot factory</a> not too far from the black box."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci una <a object|factory>fabbrica di robot</a> non troppo lontano "
"dalla scatola nera."

#. type: Bullet: '5)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manufacture a <a object|botsub>subber</a>."
msgstr "Produci un <a object|botsub>robot sommergibile</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '6)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bring the black box back on board."
msgstr "Riporta la scatola nera a bordo."

#. type: Bullet: '7)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take off."
msgstr "Decolla."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The black box is lying at the bottom of a small lake, northeast of the "
"spaceship."
msgstr ""
"La scatola nera si trova sul fondo di un laghetto a nord-est dell’astronave."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can build the bot factory right beside the lake, on the south bank."
msgstr ""
"Puoi costruire la fabbrica di robot proprio accanto al lago, sulla riva "
"meridionale."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a>"
